{"type": "user", "message": {"role": "user", "content": [{"tool_use_id": "toolu_01DoioZqsQxMhv2C43EncePv", "type": "tool_result", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "{\"excerpt_removed\": true, \"references\": [{\"url\": \"https://ko.wikipedia.org/wiki/%EC%9D%B4%ED%99%A9\"}, {\"url\": \"https://www.kci.go.kr/kciportal/landing/article.kci?arti_id=ART003050910\"}, {\"url\": \"https://www.grandculture.net/cheongsong/toc/GC06800657\"}, {\"url\": \"https://m.cafe.daum.net/yongwoofamily/NVLw/439?svc=AXZ\"}, {\"url\": \"https://m.cafe.daum.net/gobangseyee/P3zg/1\"}, {\"url\": \"https://contents.history.go.kr/mobile/eh/view.do?levelId=eh_n0415_0010\"}, {\"url\": \"https://yeongju.grandculture.net/yeongju/toc/GC07400709\"}, {\"url\": \"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/U%C5%ADij%C5%8Fng\"}, {\"url\": \"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Yi_Chongjang\"}]}"}]}]}, "parent_tool_use_id": null, "timestamp": "2026-10-20T23:52:28.011Z", "tool_use_result": {"query": "이황 1548년 단양 군수 풍기 군수 encykorea", "results": [{"tool_use_id": "srvtoolu_016MowPBFyUHUSED8WcsYxpz", "content": [{"title": "이황 - 위키백과, 우리 모두의 백과사전", "url": "https://ko.wikipedia.org/wiki/%EC%9D%B4%ED%99%A9"}, {"title": "단양 1548 -단양군수 퇴계 이황을 논함-", "url": "https://www.kci.go.kr/kciportal/landing/article.kci?arti_id=ART003050910"}, {"title": "이황 - 디지털청송문화대전", "url": "https://www.grandculture.net/cheongsong/toc/GC06800657"}, {"title": "단양 기생 두향(杜香)과 퇴계 이황(李滉)의 사랑 - 역사문화(歷史.文化)이야기 - 단양우씨 용우종친회", "url": "https://m.cafe.daum.net/yongwoofamily/NVLw/439?svc=AXZ"}, {"title": "퇴계(退溪) 이황(李滉) - 退溪퇴계이황 - 영일서단(해맞이 마을)", "url": "https://m.cafe.daum.net/gobangseyee/P3zg/1"}, {"title": "이황 - 우리역사넷", "url": "https://contents.history.go.kr/mobile/eh/view.do?levelId=eh_n0415_0010"}, {"title": "이황 - 디지털영주문화대전", "url": "https://yeongju.grandculture.net/yeongju/toc/GC07400709"}, {"title": "U%C5%ADij%C5%8Fng", "url": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/U%C5%ADij%C5%8Fng"}, {"title": "Yi Chongjang", "url": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Yi_Chongjang"}]}, "I didn't find an encykorea (한국민족문화대백과) entry in these results. The sources below are mostly Wikipedia, regional encyclopedias, and academic articles, and they agree on the basic sequence with a few date differences.\n\n- **Danyang (1548):** Yi Hwang took up the post of Danyang magistrate in January 1548 (1548년(명종 3) 1월 충청도 단양군수로 부임하여 기녀 두향을 만났다.). A KCI article gives his tenure as 1548년 1월에서 9월까지, and says he moved to Punggi in October of that year.\n- **Transfer to Punggi:** Soon after, his elder brother was appointed Chungcheong governor, and under the rule against officials serving where relatives were posted, Yi moved to Punggi magistrate in Gyeongsang-do (얼마 되지 않아 형 이해가 충청도 관찰사로 발령받자, 상피제(相避制)에 따라 경상도 풍기군수로 옮겼다.).\n- **Sosu Seowon:** As Punggi magistrate he secured royal recognition for Baekundong Seowon, which became Sosu Seowon. One source calls it 우리나라 최초의 사액서원이다. The year varies by source: 1549년(명종 4) 소수서원 사액 in the Yeongju encyclopedia, versus 1550 in the Cheongsong encyclopedia.\n- **Dates of Punggi service:** Sources differ on how long he served. One says he left office about a year after taking the post (풍기 군수로 부임한 지 1년 만에 관직에서 물러나), while another says he resigned in 1549.\n\nIf you need the encykorea entry specifically, a more targeted search on the 한국학중앙연구원 site or the encykorea title 이황 may help."], "durationSeconds": 8.010772040999997, "searchCount": 1}, "tool_result_meta": [{"id": "toolu_01DoioZqsQxMhv2C43EncePv", "permission_decision": {"decision": "accept", "source": "hook", "reason_type": "hook"}}]}
