{"type": "assistant", "message": {"model": "claude-opus-5-5", "id": "msg_011CgEPV9bfbnRWJLmX8pmeQ", "type": "message", "role": "assistant", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "**答案：1548年（明宗3年）1月**，李滉（이황，号退溪）到忠清道丹阳郡守任上，当时48岁。同年10月前后，他的哥哥李瀣被任命为忠清道观察使。按回避亲属的\"相避制\"，他改任庆尚道丰基郡守。KCI论文《단양 1548》认为他在丹阳的任期是1548年1月到9月。\n\n搜了3次。最直接的依据是前两个网址：韩文维基百科和 KCI 论文。\n\n**依据：**\n- [이황 - 위키백과](https://ko.wikipedia.org/wiki/%EC%9D%B4%ED%99%A9)\n- [단양 1548 -단양군수 퇴계 이황을 논함- (KCI)](https://www.kci.go.kr/kciportal/landing/article.kci?arti_id=ART003050910)\n- [이황 - 디지털영주문화대전](https://yeongju.grandculture.net/yeongju/toc/GC07400709)\n- [이황 - 디지털청송문화대전](https://www.grandculture.net/cheongsong/toc/GC06800657)"}], "container": null, "stop_reason": null, "stop_sequence": null, "stop_details": null, "usage": {"input_tokens": 2, "cache_creation_input_tokens": 1393, "cache_read_input_tokens": 6437, "cache_creation": {"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens": 0, "ephemeral_1h_input_tokens": 1393}, "output_tokens": 7, "service_tier": "standard", "inference_geo": "global", "speed": "standard"}, "input_transformations": [], "diagnostics": null, "context_management": null}, "parent_tool_use_id": null, "timestamp": "2026-10-20T23:52:33.695Z", "request_id": "req_011CgEPV9KJBrbEw4MoaTrXa"}
